## 2. GitHub backup architecture

Because `High-Quality_Dataset/` is outside the cloned Git repository, it is NOT automatically version-controlled by the existing clone.

Use a clean separation between the working dataset factory and its GitHub backup.

Preferred destination:

`LUNCY579/rineya-world-model-research`

Suggested dedicated branch:

`research/rineya-high-quality-dataset-v1`

Suggested tracked destination inside that branch:

`datasets/rineya_high_quality_factory_v1/`

